{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073330/extras/602fbd2ce487efcc1b6252a958a4b438.avif?t=1759925298\" width=600 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the FORKLIFT FLOWERPOT: a modern marvel of engineering perfection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fork your way around a strange archipelago and study plants across different climates and times. Change between three seasons at your whim to solve puzzles and investigate clues. Meet wacky characters, participate in local sporting events, and delve deep into the mysteries of a strange land. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073330/extras/f1c38ef216cbb98fa509709ba5ed1bf1.poster.avif?t=1759925298\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073330/extras/f1c38ef216cbb98fa509709ba5ed1bf1.webm?t=1759925298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073330/extras/f1c38ef216cbb98fa509709ba5ed1bf1.mp4?t=1759925298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a lush 2.5D claymation-inspired archipelago. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change between three strange seasons to solve puzzles. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use THE WEB to connect clues and unearth the conspiracy at the heart of Spudbubby's Speedy Shipping Company.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073330/extras/c2b5db138d0189db9bb7fe7748b07510.poster.avif?t=1759925298\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073330/extras/c2b5db138d0189db9bb7fe7748b07510.webm?t=1759925298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073330/extras/c2b5db138d0189db9bb7fe7748b07510.mp4?t=1759925298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Windy Season, gusts from the Accordion Isles race across the land, opening new paths for exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During Wet Season, a heavy rainfall from Mt.Springly covers the land and provides crucial nourishment for plant life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At Harvest Season's peak, you'll find a variety of bouncy mushrooms, fruiting plants, and ANGRY BOSSES WONDERING WHY YOU HAVEN'T REPORTED FOR YOUR HARVEST SEASON WORK SHIFT! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2073330?t=1759925298","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2073330?t=1759925298","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073330/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759925298","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073330/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759925298","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2493400,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073330/extras/602fbd2ce487efcc1b6252a958a4b438.avif?t=1759925298\" width=600 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the FORKLIFT FLOWERPOT: a modern marvel of engineering perfection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fork your way around a strange archipelago and study plants across different climates and times. Change between three seasons at your whim to solve puzzles and investigate clues. Meet wacky characters, participate in local sporting events, and delve deep into the mysteries of a strange land. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073330/extras/f1c38ef216cbb98fa509709ba5ed1bf1.poster.avif?t=1759925298\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073330/extras/f1c38ef216cbb98fa509709ba5ed1bf1.webm?t=1759925298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073330/extras/f1c38ef216cbb98fa509709ba5ed1bf1.mp4?t=1759925298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a lush 2.5D claymation-inspired archipelago. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change between three strange seasons to solve puzzles. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use THE WEB to connect clues and unearth the conspiracy at the heart of Spudbubby's Speedy Shipping Company.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073330/extras/c2b5db138d0189db9bb7fe7748b07510.poster.avif?t=1759925298\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073330/extras/c2b5db138d0189db9bb7fe7748b07510.webm?t=1759925298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073330/extras/c2b5db138d0189db9bb7fe7748b07510.mp4?t=1759925298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Windy Season, gusts from the Accordion Isles race across the land, opening new paths for exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During Wet Season, a heavy rainfall from Mt.Springly covers the land and provides crucial nourishment for plant life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At Harvest Season's peak, you'll find a variety of bouncy mushrooms, fruiting plants, and ANGRY BOSSES WONDERING WHY YOU HAVEN'T REPORTED FOR YOUR HARVEST SEASON WORK SHIFT! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","developers":["Michael Mato"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073330/header.jpg?t=1759925298","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2073330/591258/2630fd19c704f53d35ce579dcc78a7ab47a10d6b/1751071852/dash_av1.mpd?t=1691070218","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2073330/591258/2630fd19c704f53d35ce579dcc78a7ab47a10d6b/1751071852/dash_h264.mpd?t=1691070218","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2073330/591258/2630fd19c704f53d35ce579dcc78a7ab47a10d6b/1751071852/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1691070218","id":256960319,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256960319/movie480.mp4?t=1691070218","max":"https: